{"id":"u04","level":"A1","emoji":"🍽️","title":{"t":"Essen und Trinken","s":"Food and drink","a":"audio/de-en/05debed12027.mp3"},"goals":["Name common foods and drinks","Use ein/eine and kein/keine","Order politely with ich möchte","Say what you like with ich mag"],"words":[{"id":"w01","t":"das Brot","pl":"die Brote","s":"bread","emoji":"🍞","ex":{"t":"Ich esse Brot mit Käse.","s":"I eat bread with cheese.","a":"audio/de-en/4276b4025771.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f35e.svg","a":"audio/de-en/2a22e0002a20.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/7608077c15ab.mp3"},{"id":"w02","t":"der Käse","pl":"die Käse","s":"cheese","emoji":"🧀","ex":{"t":"Magst du Käse?","s":"Do you like cheese?","a":"audio/de-en/74107dbf2a7b.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f9c0.svg","a":"audio/de-en/36b14e2ad8df.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/be6bbb964342.mp3"},{"id":"w03","t":"der Reis","s":"rice (usually no plural)","emoji":"🍚","ex":{"t":"Reis ist lecker!","s":"Rice is delicious!","a":"audio/de-en/4ecb70112cc1.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f35a.svg","a":"audio/de-en/573c842a7d23.mp3"},{"id":"w04","t":"das Ei","pl":"die Eier","s":"egg","emoji":"🥚","ex":{"t":"Ich möchte ein Ei.","s":"I'd like an egg.","a":"audio/de-en/e10b5c7d0290.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f95a.svg","a":"audio/de-en/eee72716803d.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/dbd9f93d6ded.mp3"},{"id":"w05","t":"der Apfel","pl":"die Äpfel","s":"apple","emoji":"🍎","ex":{"t":"Ich mag Äpfel.","s":"I like apples.","a":"audio/de-en/d9c8bd5a5c4c.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f34e.svg","a":"audio/de-en/f4226751a1f3.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/d9fbd4f8ca36.mp3"},{"id":"w06","t":"die Banane","pl":"die Bananen","s":"banana","emoji":"🍌","ex":{"t":"Möchtest du eine Banane?","s":"Would you like a banana?","a":"audio/de-en/6bb3da6f7bc9.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f34c.svg","a":"audio/de-en/52d85e4ff564.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/b07c11d39dcc.mp3"},{"id":"w07","t":"das Hähnchen","pl":"die Hähnchen","s":"chicken (food)","emoji":"🍗","ex":{"t":"Maryam mag Hähnchen.","s":"Maryam likes chicken.","a":"audio/de-en/1977b97a0dfa.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f357.svg","a":"audio/de-en/4a8e05e4b84a.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/8db6cb0c8625.mp3"},{"id":"w08","t":"der Salat","pl":"die Salate","s":"salad","emoji":"🥗","ex":{"t":"Der Salat ist gut.","s":"The salad is good.","a":"audio/de-en/a456b09a43ef.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f957.svg","a":"audio/de-en/d3c27752eec7.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/0cdff1c4ef6a.mp3"},{"id":"w09","t":"die Suppe","pl":"die Suppen","s":"soup","emoji":"🍲","ex":{"t":"Möchten Sie eine Suppe?","s":"Would you like some soup?","a":"audio/de-en/0f626f590494.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f372.svg","a":"audio/de-en/61a2c9f0a1c2.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/8924e3660549.mp3"},{"id":"w10","t":"das Wasser","s":"water (usually no plural)","emoji":"💧","ex":{"t":"Ein Wasser, bitte.","s":"A water, please.","a":"audio/de-en/c7b73e73e0f0.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f4a7.svg","a":"audio/de-en/d3136614c9bc.mp3"},{"id":"w11","t":"der Tee","pl":"die Tees","s":"tea","emoji":"🍵","ex":{"t":"Wir trinken Tee.","s":"We drink tea.","a":"audio/de-en/142e67c57087.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f375.svg","a":"audio/de-en/261c6267467f.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/bbe09bc10642.mp3"},{"id":"w12","t":"der Kaffee","pl":"die Kaffees","s":"coffee","emoji":"☕","ex":{"t":"Herr Schmidt trinkt Kaffee.","s":"Mr. Schmidt drinks coffee.","a":"audio/de-en/a8d8018d2fc7.mp3"},"img":"img/e/2615.svg","a":"audio/de-en/e83fa2ea086b.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/6d875726f603.mp3"},{"id":"w13","t":"die Milch","s":"milk (no plural)","emoji":"🥛","ex":{"t":"Trinkst du Milch?","s":"Do you drink milk?","a":"audio/de-en/51e902e46a57.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f95b.svg","a":"audio/de-en/3f6f62f7c9b5.mp3"},{"id":"w14","t":"der Saft","pl":"die Säfte","s":"juice","emoji":"🧃","ex":{"t":"Der Saft ist lecker.","s":"The juice is delicious.","a":"audio/de-en/2073d1e769e5.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f9c3.svg","a":"audio/de-en/de4d77169eab.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/ebe66bfd335b.mp3"}],"phrases":[{"id":"p01","t":"Ich habe Hunger.","s":"I'm hungry.","a":"audio/de-en/9706d25c74d0.mp3"},{"id":"p02","t":"Ich habe Durst.","s":"I'm thirsty.","a":"audio/de-en/4ff1febab767.mp3"},{"id":"p03","t":"Was möchtest du?","s":"What would you like? (informal)","a":"audio/de-en/84b45dd11960.mp3"},{"id":"p04","t":"Was möchten Sie?","s":"What would you like? (polite)","a":"audio/de-en/e4314ca6a9ba.mp3"},{"id":"p05","t":"Ich möchte eine Suppe, bitte.","s":"I'd like some soup, please.","a":"audio/de-en/65c166d0ba01.mp3"},{"id":"p06","t":"Guten Appetit!","s":"Enjoy your meal!","a":"audio/de-en/e664af01ebb1.mp3"},{"id":"p07","t":"Das ist lecker!","s":"This is delicious!","a":"audio/de-en/04a3056f1efe.mp3"},{"id":"p08","t":"Danke, ich bin satt.","s":"Thank you, I'm full.","a":"audio/de-en/3699546f1062.mp3"}],"dialogue":{"title":{"t":"Im Café","s":"At the café","a":"audio/de-en/471860f467b0.mp3"},"speakers":{"A":{"name":"Kellner","voice":"m"},"B":{"name":"Maryam","voice":"f"}},"lines":[{"sp":"A","t":"Guten Tag! Was möchten Sie?","s":"Hello! What would you like?","a":"audio/de-en/c0c997b2ce6c.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Guten Tag! Ich möchte eine Suppe, bitte.","s":"Hello! I'd like some soup, please.","a":"audio/de-en/cd53d88c6604.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Gern. Möchten Sie auch Brot?","s":"Sure. Would you like some bread, too?","a":"audio/de-en/1f3b1f93414e.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Ja, bitte. Haben Sie auch Hähnchen?","s":"Yes, please. Do you have chicken, too?","a":"audio/de-en/02d56ad2cd89.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Nein, wir haben kein Hähnchen. Aber wir haben Salat.","s":"No, we don't have chicken. But we have salad.","a":"audio/de-en/14c97a8b63e0.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Nein, danke. Aber ich habe Durst. Ein Wasser, bitte.","s":"No, thank you. But I'm thirsty. A water, please.","a":"audio/de-en/c95738ec4779.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Also: eine Suppe, Brot und ein Wasser?","s":"So: soup, bread and a water?","a":"audio/de-en/4798059f09d7.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Ja, richtig. Danke!","s":"Yes, that's right. Thank you!","a":"audio/de-en/25fdb28903bd.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Bitte schön. Guten Appetit!","s":"You're welcome. Enjoy your meal!","a":"audio/de-en/514431ce0c73.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Danke! Die Suppe ist lecker!","s":"Thanks! The soup is delicious!","a":"audio/de-en/aad75e4e85e1.mp3"}]},"grammar":[{"id":"g01","title":{"t":"ein, eine – kein, keine","s":"\"a\" and \"no / not a\""},"explain":"**ein** / **eine** means *a* / *an*. Use **ein** with der- and das-nouns, and **eine** with die-nouns: **ein** Apfel, **eine** Banane, **ein** Ei. In the plural there is no *a*: Äpfel.\nTo say *no* / *not a*, just put a **k** in front: **kein**, **keine**. In the plural, always use **keine**: Wir haben **keine** Äpfel. With things you can't count, use kein/keine as well: Ich habe **keine** Milch.\nTip: after **haben**, **möchte** and **mag**, a der-noun changes: Ich möchte **einen** Apfel. Ich mag **keinen** Käse. You'll practice this in Unit 5.","table":[["der Apfel","ein Apfel","kein Apfel"],["die Banane","eine Banane","keine Banane"],["das Ei","ein Ei","kein Ei"],["die Äpfel","Äpfel","keine Äpfel"]],"examples":[{"t":"Das ist ein Apfel.","s":"This is an apple.","a":"audio/de-en/7c705c3488ce.mp3"},{"t":"Das ist eine Banane.","s":"This is a banana.","a":"audio/de-en/c7c497f8fd87.mp3"},{"t":"Das ist kein Ei.","s":"This is not an egg.","a":"audio/de-en/e30847bdc280.mp3"},{"t":"Ich habe keine Milch.","s":"I have no milk.","a":"audio/de-en/e093fe391c96.mp3"},{"t":"Wir haben keine Äpfel.","s":"We don't have any apples.","a":"audio/de-en/ecc73f2a743a.mp3"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","t":"Das ist ___ Banane.","options":["ein","eine"],"answer":1,"s":"This is a banana.","full":"Das ist eine Banane.","a":"audio/de-en/c7c497f8fd87.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Das ist ___ Ei.","options":["ein","eine"],"answer":0,"s":"This is an egg.","full":"Das ist ein Ei.","a":"audio/de-en/eec0b14ca70c.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Ich habe ___ Milch.","options":["kein","keine"],"answer":1,"s":"I have no milk.","full":"Ich habe keine Milch.","a":"audio/de-en/e093fe391c96.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Das ist kein Tee, das ist ___ Kaffee.","options":["ein","eine"],"answer":0,"s":"This isn't tea, it's a coffee.","full":"Das ist kein Tee, das ist ein Kaffee.","a":"audio/de-en/3e376eefa7a5.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Das ist ___ Suppe.","answer":["eine"],"s":"This is a soup.","full":"Das ist eine Suppe.","a":"audio/de-en/e14477653021.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Wir haben ___ Eier.","answer":["keine"],"s":"We have no eggs.","full":"Wir haben keine Eier.","a":"audio/de-en/3eb7705a7fae.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Das ist kein Brot.","s":"This is not bread.","full":"Das ist kein Brot.","a":"audio/de-en/9af09be32be3.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Ich möchte eine Banane.","s":"I'd like a banana.","full":"Ich möchte eine Banane.","a":"audio/de-en/cb2dd85d4725.mp3"}]},{"id":"g02","title":{"t":"ich möchte – ich mag","s":"\"I'd like\" and \"I like\""},"explain":"**ich möchte** means *I would like*. It's the polite way to ask for something – in a café, in a shop or at home: **Ich möchte eine Suppe, bitte.**\n**ich mag** means *I like* – in general: **Ich mag Reis.** To say you don't like a kind of food, you can use **kein** / **keine** (with der-nouns **keinen**): Ich mag **keine** Bananen. Ich mag **keinen** Reis.\nNote: **ich** and **er / sie / es** have the same form, with no **-t**: ich möchte, er möchte – ich mag, sie mag.","table":[["ich","möchte","mag"],["du","möchtest","magst"],["er / sie / es","möchte","mag"],["wir","möchten","mögen"],["Sie","möchten","mögen"]],"examples":[{"t":"Ich möchte ein Wasser, bitte.","s":"I'd like a water, please.","a":"audio/de-en/4de5dd622e26.mp3"},{"t":"Möchtest du Tee?","s":"Would you like some tea?","a":"audio/de-en/302b4e005714.mp3"},{"t":"Ich mag Reis.","s":"I like rice.","a":"audio/de-en/f5ab9b74be6e.mp3"},{"t":"Ali mag keine Bananen.","s":"Ali doesn't like bananas.","a":"audio/de-en/d56d51eac9fd.mp3"},{"t":"Was möchten Sie?","s":"What would you like?","a":"audio/de-en/e4314ca6a9ba.mp3"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","t":"Ich ___ ein Wasser, bitte.","options":["möchte","möchtest","möchten"],"answer":0,"s":"I'd like a water, please.","full":"Ich möchte ein Wasser, bitte.","a":"audio/de-en/4de5dd622e26.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"___ du Tee?","options":["Möchtest","Möchte","Möchten"],"answer":0,"s":"Would you like some tea?","full":"Möchtest du Tee?","a":"audio/de-en/302b4e005714.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Sara ___ Käse.","options":["mag","magst","mögen"],"answer":0,"s":"Sara likes cheese.","full":"Sara mag Käse.","a":"audio/de-en/3938c6ca9519.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Was ___ Sie?","answer":["möchten","moechten"],"s":"What would you like?","full":"Was möchten Sie?","a":"audio/de-en/e4314ca6a9ba.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Magst du Hähnchen? – Ja, ich ___ Hähnchen.","answer":["mag"],"s":"Do you like chicken? – Yes, I like chicken.","full":"Magst du Hähnchen? – Ja, ich mag Hähnchen.","a":"audio/de-en/96f10ea8d80b.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Lukas ___ eine Suppe.","answer":["möchte","moechte"],"s":"Lukas would like some soup.","full":"Lukas möchte eine Suppe.","a":"audio/de-en/79488057c789.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Ich mag keine Bananen.","s":"I don't like bananas.","full":"Ich mag keine Bananen.","a":"audio/de-en/1df7ae20ca39.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Möchten Sie Tee?","s":"Would you like some tea? (polite)","full":"Möchten Sie Tee?","a":"audio/de-en/c24281d89d7c.mp3"}]}],"reading":{"title":{"t":"Frühstück bei Familie Ahmadi","s":"Breakfast with the Ahmadi family","a":"audio/de-en/625c20b0184d.mp3"},"text":[{"t":"Hallo, ich bin Maryam.","s":"Hello, I'm Maryam.","a":"audio/de-en/4f78305903ed.mp3"},{"t":"Wir essen Brot, Käse und Eier zum Frühstück.","s":"We eat bread, cheese and eggs for breakfast.","a":"audio/de-en/3745cfff63c5.mp3"},{"t":"Ich trinke Tee, und mein Mann Ali trinkt Kaffee.","s":"I drink tea, and my husband Ali drinks coffee.","a":"audio/de-en/e54cb2c4f9a0.mp3"},{"t":"Mina mag Milch.","s":"Mina likes milk.","a":"audio/de-en/100e58288291.mp3"},{"t":"Amir mag keine Milch. Er möchte Saft.","s":"Amir doesn't like milk. He would like juice.","a":"audio/de-en/5e19d9332dd7.mp3"},{"t":"Wir haben keine Bananen, aber wir haben Äpfel.","s":"We don't have any bananas, but we have apples.","a":"audio/de-en/5bead63fd794.mp3"},{"t":"Guten Appetit!","s":"Enjoy your meal!","a":"audio/de-en/e664af01ebb1.mp3"}],"questions":[{"q":{"t":"Was trinkt Maryam?","s":"What does Maryam drink?","a":"audio/de-en/dd0c3ce1dbbe.mp3"},"options":["Tee","Kaffee","Milch"],"answer":0},{"q":{"t":"Was trinkt Ali?","s":"What does Ali drink?","a":"audio/de-en/22284f298a2b.mp3"},"options":["Tee","Kaffee","Saft"],"answer":1},{"q":{"t":"Wer mag keine Milch?","s":"Who doesn't like milk?","a":"audio/de-en/c5dc179c7905.mp3"},"options":["Mina","Amir","Ali"],"answer":1},{"q":{"t":"Was haben sie nicht?","s":"What don't they have?","a":"audio/de-en/c040d7916ff7.mp3"},"options":["Äpfel","Bananen","Käse"],"answer":1}]},"sentences":[{"t":"Ich habe Hunger.","s":"I'm hungry.","a":"audio/de-en/9706d25c74d0.mp3"},{"t":"Ich möchte ein Wasser, bitte.","s":"I'd like a water, please.","a":"audio/de-en/4de5dd622e26.mp3"},{"t":"Magst du Reis?","s":"Do you like rice?","a":"audio/de-en/e75364e431da.mp3"},{"t":"Das ist kein Kaffee.","s":"This is not coffee.","a":"audio/de-en/c513fcc10e7a.mp3"},{"t":"Wir haben keine Milch.","s":"We have no milk.","a":"audio/de-en/bf8283308149.mp3"},{"t":"Was möchten Sie?","s":"What would you like? (polite)","a":"audio/de-en/e4314ca6a9ba.mp3"},{"t":"Die Suppe ist lecker.","s":"The soup is delicious.","a":"audio/de-en/423782b4ca5f.mp3"},{"t":"Lukas mag Äpfel.","s":"Lukas likes apples.","a":"audio/de-en/abe06b509ea2.mp3"}],"img":"img/e/1f37d.svg"}